# Line endings
#
# Text files are stored with LF and checked out with LF on every platform, so every tool (editors, scripts, CI, the Nix build) sees
# the same bytes and a file never changes just because it was touched on another operating system. Git normalises on commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Visual Studio expects Windows line endings in solution files.
*.sln text eol=crlf
